    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/0201765f812ae8c12f285089328743e3.avif?t=1745976154\" data-has-big width=800 height=306 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Have you ever thought of robbing a museum in roller skates?!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you didn't think about that before, here's your chance to retrieve looted treasures, stolen from their rightful owners during colonization period centuries ago!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/3f1a7ddd3f37bd8d54283a8f754b5180.poster.avif?t=1745976154\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/3f1a7ddd3f37bd8d54283a8f754b5180.webm?t=1745976154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/3f1a7ddd3f37bd8d54283a8f754b5180.mp4?t=1745976154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Pick up your roller</strong> <strong>skates!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay a little visit to museums around the world in this fast-paced heist game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/4541bd9ea615746478eea74e7df70c2e.poster.avif?t=1745976154\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/4541bd9ea615746478eea74e7df70c2e.webm?t=1745976154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/4541bd9ea615746478eea74e7df70c2e.mp4?t=1745976154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Get those artifacts back!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take looted artifacts back to their original locations! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/4ea6c28c5f8183966d7c5998a1069a7c.poster.avif?t=1745976154\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/4ea6c28c5f8183966d7c5998a1069a7c.webm?t=1745976154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/4ea6c28c5f8183966d7c5998a1069a7c.mp4?t=1745976154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Don't be caught!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid guards! Make sure you will accomplish the missions assigned to you and repair history!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/7a8a9e7b6bcd0739e3188e79060ec923.avif?t=1745976154\" data-has-big width=800 height=596 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/0201765f812ae8c12f285089328743e3.avif?t=1745976154\" data-has-big width=800 height=306 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Have you ever thought of robbing a museum in roller skates?!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even if you didn't think about that before, here's your chance to retrieve looted treasures, stolen from their rightful owners during colonization period centuries ago!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/3f1a7ddd3f37bd8d54283a8f754b5180.poster.avif?t=1745976154\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/3f1a7ddd3f37bd8d54283a8f754b5180.webm?t=1745976154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/3f1a7ddd3f37bd8d54283a8f754b5180.mp4?t=1745976154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Pick up your roller</strong> <strong>skates!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pay a little visit to museums around the world in this fast-paced heist game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/4541bd9ea615746478eea74e7df70c2e.poster.avif?t=1745976154\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/4541bd9ea615746478eea74e7df70c2e.webm?t=1745976154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/4541bd9ea615746478eea74e7df70c2e.mp4?t=1745976154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Get those artifacts back!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take looted artifacts back to their original locations! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/4ea6c28c5f8183966d7c5998a1069a7c.poster.avif?t=1745976154\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/4ea6c28c5f8183966d7c5998a1069a7c.webm?t=1745976154\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/4ea6c28c5f8183966d7c5998a1069a7c.mp4?t=1745976154\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Don't be caught!</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid guards! Make sure you will accomplish the missions assigned to you and repair history!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3421310/extras/7a8a9e7b6bcd0739e3188e79060ec923.avif?t=1745976154\" data-has-big width=800 height=596 /></span></p>",
